{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Selflip Video Mirror 是一款專注修正 iPhone 或 iPad 影片鏡像問題的工具，適合處理自拍、前置鏡頭錄影、社交媒體短片、教學與簡報素材。它可將影片水平翻轉並輸出修正版本，讓畫面中反向的文字、標誌、招牌或周圍景物回復正常。現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-277.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>快速水平翻轉影片</h2>\n<p>匯入需要處理的影片後，只需選擇水平翻轉，即可預覽修正效果並輸出成品，操作集中而直接，無須開啟完整影片編輯器或處理複雜時間軸。無論是自拍片段、前置鏡頭錄影，還是社交媒體短片與教學簡報，都能輕鬆校正鏡像畫面，讓文字、標誌、招牌及周圍環境不再反向。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-288-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-289-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-290-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-291-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-292-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Selflip Video Mirror</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/selflip-video-mirror/id6810246529?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T22:44:19.162102+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T22:27:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T23:37:52.332041+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T22:37:45.796478+00:00","content_hash":"4a5b8513b77f02b3d7dd73dbf255806da931e766b7a3cb5b33299213f88b18c0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}